comment author Shinryuu
comment Combined movie: Shinryuu's unpublished, faster run (reconstructed from his video) from the start to Wily 4, combined with our improvements (v3 Guts Tank fight, v4.1 Wily 4, v4.2 Wily 5/6 re-synchronised). Wily 5: the Bubble Man refight fill ends 4 frames earlier (different underwater slow-down phase), a pause-menu Up+Down trick recovers the Wood exit frame, refight RNG re-synced. 223 frames faster than publication 4410.
